From 6366f5a99ce7558f9743070e4d3e4d54ee76978d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arena Agent <agent@arena.ai>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 03:52:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ci: consolidate duplicate workflows into one pipeline that
 runs pytest

Replace linter.yml and deploy-video-pipeline.yml (which overlapped on
black/flake8/ESLint and neither ran the backend test suite) with a single
ci.yml exposing four jobs: backend-quality, backend-tests,
frontend-quality, capability-registry.

- backend-tests is new: 322 tests previously never ran on pull requests.
- ffmpeg is installed in CI so the two skipif-guarded render-path tests
  actually execute instead of silently skipping.
- capability-registry (EP-001) is its own job so drift is not masked by
  an unrelated lint failure.

No test was modified, skipped, or loosened.

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
